://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_pGKQpLtv5kQ7kNvwHjYd29&_nc_oc=AdrOB4CTFYHhG2Cqtjm2aRXDUYifw0o1PkKDkKcbMr1GfqwCqj4BGFMPUi4sYZ_bzNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9zCX_mrT7Mhd61JgFpcl-OQpq1-_PwmXOR_b7pND7_UQ&oe=6A297DE6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8rVhsS9XBjYQ7kNvwE1gGn2&_nc_oc=AdpSkERvnPuLwLIs_bz6faiNtpfNJbXEBzh7jKyIiyVgaL6KB2fubu0jh6iV80yNMno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9mMkAesj-HKoAhwF9RLBj7YpiZY153Kds-sRZX6xfYQw&oe=6A297332"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1dmQqObgZdgQ7kNvwHwbDTV&_nc_oc=AdoQQvCngD7j0wtdflS3SAQzOWEIzEFfYOHN3S2ajPQXUzPfbQgdtiY6EJ0C-XycA1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-7EWIWA-NHSQaaNzCCv_SSPKSuOGaHnRK9UPcSZYzJOA&oe=6A296CFB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FkM-harkerMQ7kNvwHRvc6c&_nc_oc=AdrGqLKTATrkfLTIP9A3ndHsXsFNTwcR3vUV1p9MNofxe9PbQ1bP3-1nwXsTkrtZ6S0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WNrdzSgORF8xNoB_QkQqkHUcrOHgq77pitBpfB01Kww&oe=6A298273"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wOc0Dd-2sZgQ7kNvwE38bRt&_nc_oc=Adp6Gd-T14gWxsSjm2IaTS4T7_Nr-32i6FAWh73fA1aRfRENS5LqRd22jrUUfFnCZmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af80sn6bpOSB5bA3Frbbl3AYbk-Nz4Bo94SfK3KdXSN12Q&oe=6A298072"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4JapuD10mBcQ7kNvwHg8ZPO&_nc_oc=Adq5455zXYkwQWq5YGLk7uiVv4Gh7IYARh2coBsw_kolt6hZc1BqqrY8KZzeHLGwKsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-UrwhtXS3QWh4-EPLAnSBj_Z-6fdyb4DxciBDbUhVCsw&oe=6A2977D3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zZgX3pZuDRkQ7kNvwGPNLz5&_nc_oc=AdqXaOMmSzEWpQtgHQfDs8mDmjnI5URgBB5WouOhkD8V_n8xTKN891pkEcsF8I_2fBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_5FujwFBrcvridFpDbWFXRRaMBpbl3VODlOzifA3VFwA&oe=6A2973EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m8WQts-972sQ7kNvwHQEKZF&_nc_oc=AdrvHNEN9-dracM6W59JA8hg2DQuI4B4dm7XLfUz66862KCSNWQzFxPuanB5r_VARP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8wZ7le8qXpZ0sGt9ZixVEOh2uQAbHm3Nna23izcmLZkA&oe=6A297FA2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164